{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25598410",
      "title": "Adding Validation & Resetting Logic",
      "sourceHash": "ee56a433bf5763233475ef4fb2b9769c7d6b4d56766ff0fcd80e6b648ce686b1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.28,
          "end": 4.11,
          "en": "Let's implement that resetting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.11,
          "end": 5.75,
          "en": "and validation logic together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.75,
          "end": 8.03,
          "en": "And let's start with resetting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.03,
          "end": 10.13,
          "en": "Resetting generally is easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.13,
          "end": 12.13,
          "en": "Here in add user handler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.13,
          "end": 14.53,
          "en": "I just wanna call set entered username",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.53,
          "end": 16.76,
          "en": "and set this again to an empty string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.76,
          "end": 19.893,
          "en": "and do to the same also for set entered age.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.07,
          "end": 23.67,
          "en": "Now, with that, I reset my states to an empty string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.67,
          "end": 26.88,
          "en": "once I locked these states snapshot here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.88,
          "end": 28.56,
          "en": "Now, what you'll see, however,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.56,
          "end": 32.12,
          "en": "is that if I save this and I enter max and whoops,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.12,
          "end": 34.23,
          "en": "max and 31,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.23,
          "end": 35.83,
          "en": "we get the output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.83,
          "end": 38.59,
          "en": "but the inputs are actually not cleared.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.59,
          "end": 41.2,
          "en": "So setting our state snapshots to empty strings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.2,
          "end": 43.56,
          "en": "doesn't seem to work here, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.56,
          "end": 45.45,
          "en": "Well, it actually does work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.45,
          "end": 47.03,
          "en": "But one problem we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 47.03,
          "end": 50.603,
          "en": "is that we don't reflect our current state in the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.603,
          "end": 54.08,
          "en": "That's not a problem as long as we don't wanna change it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.08,
          "end": 57.14,
          "en": "from anywhere else than user keystrokes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.14,
          "end": 60.313,
          "en": "But here I want to change it when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.16,
          "end": 65.43,
          "en": "So I wanna feed the current state for entered username",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.43,
          "end": 68.6,
          "en": "and entered age back into those inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.6,
          "end": 70.21000000000001,
          "en": "And we can easily do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.21000000000001,
          "end": 73.28999999999999,
          "en": "These input elements have value props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.28999999999999,
          "end": 75.13,
          "en": "And we can set them to values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.13,
          "end": 78.11,
          "en": "which will then be reflected in the inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.11,
          "end": 81.03999999999999,
          "en": "And I can set my value of that first input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.03999999999999,
          "end": 83.28,
          "en": "to entered username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.28,
          "end": 88.07,
          "en": "and the value of the second input here to entered age.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.07,
          "end": 89.82,
          "en": "And now I'll reformat that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.82,
          "end": 91.69,
          "en": "And with that, we'll have inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.69,
          "end": 94.57,
          "en": "which actually reflect the current state snapshot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.57,
          "end": 97.44,
          "en": "even if it's not changed for a keystroke,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.44,
          "end": 99.90299999999999,
          "en": "but like here, up on a form submission.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.84,
          "end": 103.34,
          "en": "So if we now save that and try again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.34,
          "end": 105.94,
          "en": "You'll see that now it's cleared.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.94,
          "end": 107.32,
          "en": "So that's step one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.32,
          "end": 109.634,
          "en": "Now for the validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.634,
          "end": 112.41,
          "en": "For the validation here in ad user handler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 112.41,
          "end": 114.57300000000001,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that all this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 114.57300000000001,
          "end": 118.46000000000001,
          "en": "only executes if we have valid inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 118.46000000000001,
          "end": 121.4,
          "en": "So if neither the name nor or the age is empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 121.4,
          "end": 123.893,
          "en": "and the age is also not smaller than one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 124.9,
          "end": 126.58,
          "en": "For that we can enter if check here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.58,
          "end": 131.58,
          "en": "And check if entered username trimmed is actually empty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.24,
          "end": 136.42000000000002,
          "en": "which we can check by checking its length.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 136.42000000000002,
          "end": 139.28,
          "en": "Trim will remove any excess white space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.28,
          "end": 141.07999999999998,
          "en": "And if it then has a length of zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 141.07999999999998,
          "end": 143.57999999999998,
          "en": "we know there is no character in that string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 143.57999999999998,
          "end": 144.633,
          "en": "it's an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 145.47,
          "end": 149.487,
          "en": "And if that's the case or if entered age is empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.8,
          "end": 158.8,
          "en": "so if we have to same check here, then I want to return.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.45,
          "end": 160.94,
          "en": "For now I'll not do anything else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 160.94,
          "end": 163.25,
          "en": "If I return here, oops, here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.25,
          "end": 165.07,
          "en": "then this code is not going to execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 165.07,
          "end": 169.27,
          "en": "because return statements finished the function execution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.27,
          "end": 172.4,
          "en": "Now I also want to check for my age input value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.4,
          "end": 175.01,
          "en": "Not just if it's empty, but also if it's not empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.01,
          "end": 177.16,
          "en": "if it's maybe smaller than one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 177.16,
          "end": 179.01,
          "en": "So I'll have a number condition here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 179.01,
          "end": 180.4,
          "en": "A number if check.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 180.4,
          "end": 185.183,
          "en": "Where I check if entered age is smaller than one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186.06,
          "end": 188.73,
          "en": "And if that's the case, I always want a return.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.73,
          "end": 191.2,
          "en": "Now here's one important thing to keep in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 191.2,
          "end": 194.48,
          "en": "entered age is actually a string, not a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 194.48,
          "end": 196.82999999999998,
          "en": "We initialize it to a string here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.82999999999998,
          "end": 198.802,
          "en": "And anything that's entered into input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 198.802,
          "end": 201.76,
          "en": "is always retrieved as a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 201.76,
          "end": 205.51,
          "en": "That's just how JavaScript and the dominance on works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 205.51,
          "end": 207.54,
          "en": "So we have a string here, entered ages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 207.54,
          "end": 209.55,
          "en": "a string not a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 209.55,
          "end": 211.56,
          "en": "Now I'm comparing it to a number here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 211.56,
          "end": 214.63,
          "en": "And generally that should work in JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 214.63,
          "end": 217.628,
          "en": "but to be super safe we can force a conversion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 217.628,
          "end": 221.87,
          "en": "of entered age to a number by adding a plus here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 221.87,
          "end": 225.233,
          "en": "And with that we ensure that well, it is a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 226.77,
          "end": 228.31,
          "en": "With that if I now save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 228.31,
          "end": 230.4,
          "en": "you will see that if I click add user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 230.4,
          "end": 233.64,
          "en": "we now got no log here on the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 233.64,
          "end": 237.61,
          "en": "If I enter max 31, on the other hand, we do get a log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.61,
          "end": 241.42,
          "en": "If I enter max and the age is empty, I get no log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 241.42,
          "end": 245.67,
          "en": "And if I enter a negative age, let's say I also get no log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 245.67,
          "end": 250.293,
          "en": "So our validation, our basic validation here seems to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 251.53,
          "end": 255.14,
          "en": "Now we'll take care about the error modal later for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 255.14,
          "end": 256.21,
          "en": "Let's make sure that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 256.21,
          "end": 259.46,
          "en": "for the cases where we do get valid inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 259.46,
          "end": 261.57,
          "en": "we actually take those inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 261.57,
          "end": 264.42,
          "en": "and we store the different users in a list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 264.42,
          "end": 267.26,
          "en": "which we then render below the input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267.26,
          "end": 269.4,
          "en": "Now, again, you can try this on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.4,
          "end": 272.713,
          "en": "Otherwise we'll build this together over the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
